A||X||43||84segirl||I'm sorry, but this has to be said!!!||||8||
Z||000000||84segirl||02-07-2001||07:40 PM||||I do realize this will probably cause hurt feelings or strike emotion from most, so I apologize upfront, but I can't take it anymore. I write this knowing I am going to offend others and that it will cause me to be burned over and over on this forum and as a new member that probably is not a good thing but here it goes. I only hope for the best for Mr. Barber and that he has a speedy and full recovery. But all this, almost flat out begging for money, has become sickening. If people want to send money they will. I am sorry the man had an accident but you cannot go on to a forum such as this and ask for money for him over and over and over. Once is fine and if those feel inclined enough to send, then great. People even went on as far as to want to gather a fund together to buy Mr. barber a new fiero gt to replace his 4 cyl. se.. Yet more badgering, playing on the kindness of most people wanting to help there fellow man. It has almost gotten to the point of harassment showing the deposit, or lack of deposit, slips on the forum. I am sure others have to feel this way and feel they are unable to voice there true feelings for fear of retrobution on this forum. And you can't tell me that won't happen. Once again, I hope Mr. Barber has a full recovery, but please stop with the play on emotions and begging for money. If people want to help they will...............||||reg||8
