Z||000003||theogre||02-07-2001||07:50 PM||||You won't hear any burn from me..... You have a definate point. I don't wish anyone ill. There have been several people here with major illness/injury/etc over the last couple years. I'm one of them myself. I find the way the Barber benifit stuff is being done irritating to offensive. <P>Certain aspects of it may infact be illegal. Persons involved with the administration of it need to consult their attourneys before doing these things.||||reg||1
Z||000004||sqoach||02-07-2001||07:52 PM||||ok you have a point. but, the main thing here was that a lot of people favored the idea and said they would contribute, but that hasn't shown in the fund deposit. this includes me too. i think everyone needs to cool off and give if you want or don't give if you don't want to. it's as simple as that.<P>BTW, welcome.<P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
