Z||000008||gtsonly||02-07-2001||09:19 PM||||I agree with 84segirl. The constant asking for donations is just not right. If a person wants to help, let that person and only him or her decide to help. To constantly ask for money and then have the odestity to post the deposit records or as said "lack of", in my opinion, is a new low and I would be ashamed to even be a part of it. I do wish health and well being not only to Mr. Barber but to all of us who have illness' but who have had the decency not to to advantage of the sympathy of others. <P>------------------<BR>Chris Hatch <BR>1986 GT w/T-TOPs||||reg||1
