Z||000018||84segirl||02-07-2001||10:24 PM||||haze, since march of 2000 you have posted 1824 posts. that averages out to 5.88 posts a day. you should not talk about people living there lives to read this site!||||reg||1
Z||000019||Haze_Performance||02-07-2001||10:40 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84segirl:<BR><B>haze, since march of 2000 you have posted 1824 posts. that averages out to 5.88 posts a day. you should not talk about people living there lives to read this site!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Well that was a great come back... If you care to look at my posts in the past. You would see that most of them were of me selling, giving away parts & asking questions... Ive never had a complaint about <B>ANY</B> of my posts. And Ive made quite a few friends here. As for the amount of time I spend in the forum... I work 50 hours a week, work on both of my Fiero's and have very full social life. But thanks for caring  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>WS6 Fieros "Members Photo Page"</A>||||reg||6
Z||000020||wkayl||02-07-2001||10:53 PM||||Sorry but I have to break my word and post again on this topic.  I don’t know who you are or how long you have been reading this Forum (you say several months).  The reason for posting the deposit information is legally all the money in that account is MINE.  I have the checkbook, the ATM card, and the right to withdraw the money for any reason I want.  That being said, all the information with that account is made public to everyone here to see.  I made the condition that if I opened the account I would scan the statement and makes it available for everyone to see how much was deposited and where the money went.  Do a search of all the posts on this topic and you will find that out for yourself.  The only way you would have known about the deposit statement is if you looked for it.  There are hundreds if not thousands of people and organizations out there wanting your money for one thing or another.  Do they give you the option of viewing every penny received and distributed? (I reserve the right to defend any statements I have made or may make in the future)  ||||reg||1
